# Auth System Implementation Plan — SHARP Rebuild

> Phase 1: Core authentication for the school portal (Principal + Teacher + Student)

---

## Finalized Decisions (From Discussion)

All decisions below were agreed upon in our architecture discussion. This section exists as a reference — not for re-debate.

### Teacher & Student Auth
| Aspect | Decision |
|---|---|
| First login | **Mobile-only**. No web first-time login. |
| Activation | Phone → OTP → Set 6-digit PIN → Account activated → Device = primary |
| PIN visibility | PIN viewable inside the mobile app (stored locally in Keychain/Keystore, hashed on server) |
| Web login | Phone + 6-digit PIN (no OTP, no password) |
| New mobile login | Phone + 6-digit PIN → becomes additional device |
| Lost device recovery | OTP → Reset PIN → Set new primary device (admin-initiated lock if SIM stolen) |
| Session (mobile) | Persistent (30-day refresh token). Phone's own lock screen = security. |
| Session (web) | 2-hour idle timeout default. "Stay signed in" checkbox → 7-day session. |
| QR scan login | **Phase 2** — WhatsApp Web style, deferred |
| Student | Same as teacher, mobile-only platform |

### Principal Auth
| Aspect | Decision |
|---|---|
| Account creation | SuperAdmin creates → system generates activation link → sent to email |
| Activation | Click link → verify mobile OTP → set password (12+ chars) → setup TOTP (mandatory) |
| Daily login (trusted device) | Email + Password |
| New device login | Email + Password + TOTP code |
| Password reset | Email reset link → new password + verify TOTP. Lost TOTP → SuperAdmin reset. |
| Session | 15-min access token + 30-day refresh. "Trust device" prompt on new device. |

### System-Wide
| Aspect | Decision |
|---|---|
| School selector | **None**. Server resolves school from credentials. Mini-picker only if phone maps to 2+ schools. |
| Self-signup | **None**. All accounts provisioned by authorized roles. |
| Password hashing | Argon2id |
| Token strategy | RS256 JWT (15-min access) + HttpOnly Secure SameSite=Strict cookie (refresh) |
| Rate limiting | Redis sliding window |
| OTP delivery | MSG91 (SMS) + Resend/SES (email) |

### Deferred to Phase 2
- Company website (SuperAdmin/SalesAdmin portal)
- QR scan web login (WhatsApp Web style)
- Push-to-approve from mobile app
- Biometric app-level lock

