#### Auth Endpoints

**Public (no auth required):**

| Method | Path | Purpose | Rate Limit |
|---|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/auth/login/password` | Principal/SuperAdmin: email + password | 5/15min per IP+email |
| `POST` | `/auth/login/pin` | Teacher/Student: phone/appId + PIN | 5/15min per IP+phone |
| `POST` | `/auth/login/totp-verify` | Principal: TOTP code after password on new device | 5/15min per user |
| `POST` | `/auth/otp/send` | Send OTP for activation/recovery | 3/10min per phone |
| `POST` | `/auth/otp/verify` | Verify OTP code | 3 per code |
| `POST` | `/auth/activate/teacher` | Teacher/Student: OTP verified → set PIN | 1 per user (idempotent) |
| `POST` | `/auth/activate/principal` | Principal: set password + TOTP via activation link | 1 per token |
| `POST` | `/auth/activate/totp-setup` | Principal: generate TOTP QR + backup codes | Requires activation session |
| `POST` | `/auth/activate/totp-confirm` | Principal: verify first TOTP code to finalize | Requires activation session |
| `POST` | `/auth/password/forgot` | Send reset link to principal email | 3/hour per email |
| `POST` | `/auth/password/reset` | Set new password via reset token + TOTP | 1 per token |
| `POST` | `/auth/pin/reset` | Reset PIN via verified OTP | 1 per OTP session |
| `POST` | `/auth/token/refresh` | Exchange refresh token for new access token | 30/min |
| `POST` | `/auth/resolve-identity` | Given phone/appId, return profile card data (name, avatar, school) | 10/min per IP |

**Authenticated:**

| Method | Path | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/auth/me` | Current user profile + role + school |
| `POST` | `/auth/logout` | Revoke current refresh token + clear cookie |
| `POST` | `/auth/logout-all` | Revoke ALL sessions |
| `GET` | `/auth/devices` | List trusted devices |
| `DELETE` | `/auth/devices/{id}` | Revoke a trusted device |
| `POST` | `/auth/pin/change` | Change PIN (requires current PIN) |

**Admin-only:**

| Method | Path | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/admin/auth/create-user` | Provision a new account (principal/teacher/student) |
| `POST` | `/admin/auth/lock-account` | Lock a user account (lost device scenario) |
| `POST` | `/admin/auth/unlock-account` | Unlock a locked account |
| `POST` | `/admin/auth/reset-pin` | Admin-initiated PIN reset for staff/student |
| `POST` | `/admin/auth/reset-principal` | SuperAdmin resets principal password + TOTP |

