### Manual Verification

| Test Case | Steps | Expected |
|---|---|---|
| Teacher activation (mobile) | Open app → enter phone → receive OTP → enter OTP → set PIN → confirm PIN | Account status = `active`, PIN hash stored, device registered as primary |
| Teacher web login | Open web → enter phone → see profile card → enter PIN | JWT issued, session active, idle timeout works |
| Teacher wrong PIN (5x) | Enter wrong PIN 5 times on web | Account locked, "Account locked" screen shown, auto-unlock after 1 hour |
| Teacher forgot PIN | Tap "Forgot PIN" → enter phone → OTP → set new PIN | New PIN works, old PIN rejected, old sessions revoked |
| Principal activation | Click email link → verify mobile OTP → set password → setup TOTP → verify code | Account active, TOTP enabled, redirected to onboarding |
| Principal daily login (trusted) | Enter email + password on trusted device | Logged in without TOTP prompt |
| Principal new device | Enter email + password on new device | TOTP prompt shown, login completes after valid code |
| Principal forgot password | Click "Forgot password" → receive email → click link → new password + TOTP | Password changed, old sessions revoked |
| Session timeout (web) | Log in → idle for 2+ hours | Auto-logout, redirected to login page |
| Admin lock account | Principal locks teacher account from admin panel | Teacher's all sessions revoked, login returns "Account locked" |
| PIN viewable in app | Settings → "My Login PIN" → biometric prompt → reveal | PIN displayed correctly, matches what was set |
| Multi-school phone | Phone exists in 2 schools → enter on web/mobile | School picker shown with both school names + emblems |
| Rate limiting | Send 4 OTPs in 10 min to same number | 4th attempt blocked with "Too many requests" |
